        {
          "text": "Na Yehoshafati akakaa Yerusalemu; akatoka tena kwenda kati ya watu toka Beer-sheba mpaka milima ya Efraimu, akawarudisha kwa BWANA, Mungu wa baba zao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.19.4",
